Comment: 0,0:01:58.57,0:02:00.81,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵  喵  喵  喵  喵
Comment: 0,0:02:01.63,0:02:02.44,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵
Comment: 0,0:02:06.78,0:02:08.22,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H3B2CD5&}太不可思议了...
Comment: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.37,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}太超模了
Comment: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:14.29,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}令人无法抗拒
Comment: 0,0:02:17.18,0:02:20.18,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}在狭窄的道路上  我们巧合地相遇了
Comment: 0,0:02:20.25,0:02:23.20,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}立马就被你那黑洞一样的深邃眼神所吸引
Comment: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:25.25,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}你的冷漠、温柔和夸张
Comment: 0,0:02:25.25,0:02:27.27,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}为何会让我心跳不已呢？？
Comment: 0,0:02:29.91,0:02:32.87,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}下午可能会下雨
Comment: 0,0:02:33.05,0:02:36.13,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}不如提前去吃午饭吧
Comment: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:39.37,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}在阳光下尽情享受着日光浴
Comment: 0,0:02:39.37,0:02:42.37,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}这小可爱到底是何方神圣
Comment: 0,0:02:43.19,0:02:46.41,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}从今往后  我都是属于你的了
Comment: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:49.49,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}过度的深爱  让时空也扭曲了
Comment: 0,0:02:49.49,0:02:53.39,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}不知不觉间  你已经成为了我的宇宙
Comment: 0,0:02:53.41,0:02:54.38,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}怦怦直跳心情
Comment: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:55.79,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}让我倍感煎熬...
Comment: 0,0:02:55.79,0:02:58.96,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}说是命运也好  奇迹也罢
Comment: 0,0:02:58.96,0:03:02.03,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}我们的相遇就是宇宙大爆炸
Comment: 0,0:03:02.03,0:03:05.96,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}夜空中悬挂的星星就是奇迹
Comment: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:09.04,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}纯然的爱不需要自我
Comment: 0,0:03:09.91,0:03:12.96,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H19A20C&}我只想一直陪在你的身边...
